        "node_id": "n_11_65ed6b",
        "thought_text": "Consider using a modified Dijkstra's algorithm that accounts for the delay compensation rule. Specifically, ensure that the algorithm checks if any combination of trains results in a journey longer than 30 minutes after accounting for delays.",
